<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-May.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-May.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa in store as of the end of May/early June. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		    Total	Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	 569,000    31,813.427 (inc 4,834.256 forw sales)</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN  136,250    15,508.418</p>
<p>ANTWERP	   133,003     1,449.828 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS)   60,000     1,799.447 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM	  14,725     2,190.095 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>The following are changes to month-earlier levels:</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM   DOWN  40,000	 HAMBURG/BREMEN    DOWN  9,450</p>
<p>ANTWERP	 UP  18,058	 UK (ALL PORTS)    DOWN  3,000</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM   DOWN   1,025</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
